{"version":1,"content":"<p>上午10時許，觀塘成業街19至21號成業工業大廈一單位業主，聯同執達吏上門收樓時，發現單位內有大量爬蟲動物屍體，於是報警。</p><p>警方經初步點算約有20隻龜、2條魚及7隻蜥蜴，遂通知愛護動物協會到場協助處理。</p><p>案件列作殘酷虐待動物，正追查涉案租戶身分。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:41:37.506982+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:28:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T08:18:17.564068+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:38:12.611682+00:00","content_hash":"75fc7167b3902747445291b47e8a161c72b4ed81e076ee5463c0b4a500da799d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}